// Lake County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (The News-Herald, the
// Willoughby chamber, WKYC and the Kirtland and Perry libraries) were checked in a
// browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Lake County ESC is now the Educational Service Center of the Western
//     Reserve (same lcesc.k12.oh.us site).
//   * Lake Health is part of University Hospitals (UH TriPoint and UH Lake West).
//   * The county port authority is now the Lake Development Authority
//     (ldauthority.org; lcport.org redirects there).
//   * The Mentor Area Chamber is at mentorchamber.org; the Willoughby chamber is the
//     Willoughby Western Lake County Chamber (wwlcchamber.com).
//   * Grand River's current site is grandriverohio.gov.
//   * The Auditor's property search is still Tyler iasWorld Public Access.
//   * Kirtland Temple passed from the Community of Christ to the Church of Jesus
//     Christ of Latter-day Saints in 2024; its "Historic Kirtland" page is used.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Lake County IL/IN/FL/CA/MN/CO/MI and others; lakecochamber.com is California;
//   madisonmohawks.org is a different Madison Local; Mentor MN; Madison WI; Fairport
//   NY; Chardon Local is Geauga County.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Nine cities (Painesville, the seat; Mentor; Mentor-on-the-Lake; Willoughby;
//     Willoughby Hills; Eastlake; Willowick; Wickliffe; Kirtland) and eight villages
//     with sites; Lakeline has none. Five townships have sites.
//   * Nine school districts (Mentor, Willoughby-Eastlake, Painesville City,
//     Riverside, Perry, Madison, Kirtland, Wickliffe, Fairport Harbor), Auburn Career
//     Center, Lakeland Community College and Lake Erie College.
//   * Lake Metroparks runs most county parks, the Farmpark and two golf courses.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * lakecountylandbank.org: an unfinished template with a placeholder phone.
//   * The Indian Museum of Lake County (site not updated since 2021) and the Lake
//     County Captains (private sports business).
//   * The Village of Lakeline, Madison Fire District and the Eleventh District Court
//     of Appeals: no site of their own found.
//   * Vendor portals: CourtView, probate records, sheriff sales, Recorder land records.

